(7148285, 1096261, 19825, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Would have worked well also for Trees challenge.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Would have worked well also for Trees challenge.', '2013-12-27 17:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148319, 1096190, 10848, '<td valign="top">Already voted coming back to comment. Love this image. The darkness reflects the cold nature of winter, the lone person adds mystery.</td>', 'Already voted coming back to comment. Love this image. The darkness reflects the cold nature of winter, the lone person adds mystery.', '2013-12-27 19:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148365, 1096228, 173844, '<td valign="top">The mini-icicles add vertical depth to this elevated network of ice, bringing it to life.</td>', 'The mini-icicles add vertical depth to this elevated network of ice, bringing it to life.', '2013-12-27 23:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148366, 1096261, 173844, '<td valign="top">This scene is well-served by the fish-eye lens.  The trees leaning inward could be druids.</td>', 'This scene is well-served by the fish-eye lens.  The trees leaning inward could be druids.', '2013-12-27 23:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148367, 1096249, 173844, '<td valign="top">A fantasy of refractions and highlights on a clear winter day.  The colorful bokeh is charming.</td>', 'A fantasy of refractions and highlights on a clear winter day.  The colorful bokeh is charming.', '2013-12-27 23:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148369, 1095800, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling of regeneration here.</td>', 'I like the feeling of regeneration here.', '2013-12-27 23:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148371, 1096119, 173844, '<td valign="top">This feels like a 1950''s science fiction movie.  At least humanity was warned.  Suitably processed to enhance the portentousness.</td>', 'This feels like a 1950''s science fiction movie.  At least humanity was warned.  Suitably processed to enhance the portentousness.', '2013-12-27 23:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148373, 1096024, 173844, '<td valign="top">The central child seems to be being endowed with super power amidst the obliviousness of the hoi polloi.  Calmly cinematic, aided by the wide angle lens.</td>', 'The central child seems to be being endowed with super power amidst the obliviousness of the hoi polloi.  Calmly cinematic, aided by the wide angle lens.', '2013-12-27 23:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148374, 1096282, 173844, '<td valign="top">It has already cheerfully arrived.  Still, it''s but a first dusting.</td>', 'It has already cheerfully arrived.  Still, it''s but a first dusting.', '2013-12-27 23:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148375, 1096200, 173844, '<td valign="top">I wonder where this is.  The solstice seems to be inconsequential in these climes, or am I reading this incorrectly?  In any case, a strong, clear and deep landscape taken from a terrific vantage point and nicely brought to  life in black and white.</td>', 'I wonder where this is.  The solstice seems to be inconsequential in these climes, or am I reading this incorrectly?  In any case, a strong, clear and deep landscape taken from a terrific vantage point and nicely brought to  life in black and white.', '2013-12-27 23:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148376, 1096130, 173844, '<td valign="top">Pleasantly captures a moment of the day just when someone is biking past.</td>', 'Pleasantly captures a moment of the day just when someone is biking past.', '2013-12-27 23:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148378, 1096191, 173844, '<td valign="top">The interesting shadows cast by the nails and something unknown outside the frame have a strong ritualistic feel in keeping with the ancient importance of the day.  The title points the way.</td>', 'The interesting shadows cast by the nails and something unknown outside the frame have a strong ritualistic feel in keeping with the ancient importance of the day.  The title points the way.', '2013-12-27 23:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148381, 1096250, 173844, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image of a pretty child on a black and white decorative blanket swaddled in a colorfully contrasting towel.  The sun glints off her blond hair, golden skin and earring.  The viewpoint is perfect.</td>', 'A beautiful image of a pretty child on a black and white decorative blanket swaddled in a colorfully contrasting towel.  The sun glints off her blond hair, golden skin and earring.  The viewpoint is perfect.', '2013-12-27 23:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148383, 1096300, 173844, '<td valign="top">An ordinary winter day, extraordinarily portrayed.  The waterfowl add that further dimension of life.</td>', 'An ordinary winter day, extraordinarily portrayed.  The waterfowl add that further dimension of life.', '2013-12-27 23:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148384, 1096211, 173844, '<td valign="top">The clouds are a tad flamboyant.  This scene would still be impressive if presented in a more naturalistic manner.  It''s not my vision, though.</td>', 'The clouds are a tad flamboyant.  This scene would still be impressive if presented in a more naturalistic manner.  It''s not my vision, though.', '2013-12-27 23:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148385, 1096306, 173844, '<td valign="top">The emerging horse is beautiful, the slender branch is magically highlighted and an optical illusion, too.  I like this very much.</td>', 'The emerging horse is beautiful, the slender branch is magically highlighted and an optical illusion, too.  I like this very much.', '2013-12-27 23:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148387, 1096264, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice enchanted look to this forest, appropriate to the day.</td>', 'Nice enchanted look to this forest, appropriate to the day.', '2013-12-28 00:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148389, 1096101, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully tells a story of a wary man surviving the dark mysteries of the solstice with his Christian amulets.  In his thick-walled but still chilly room, peering out the window, the old days and old ways are not forgotten.  My favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Beautifully tells a story of a wary man surviving the dark mysteries of the solstice with his Christian amulets.  In his thick-walled but still chilly room, peering out the window, the old days and old ways are not forgotten.  My favorite of the challenge.', '2013-12-28 00:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148390, 1095954, 173844, '<td valign="top">Can''t say it better than this.</td>', 'Can''t say it better than this.', '2013-12-28 00:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148392, 1096103, 173844, '<td valign="top">Reminiscent of Grandma Moses, updated.  Very charming, I like this a lot.</td>', 'Reminiscent of Grandma Moses, updated.  Very charming, I like this a lot.', '2013-12-28 00:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148393, 1095908, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting shadow.</td>', 'Interesting shadow.', '2013-12-28 00:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148394, 1096184, 173844, '<td valign="top">Now I''m really jealous.  Enjoy your summer!</td>', 'Now I''m really jealous.  Enjoy your summer!', '2013-12-28 00:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148397, 1096041, 173844, '<td valign="top">Crepuscular rays over the palms.  <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>The sun''s giving its all.  Crepuscular rays over the patient palms.</td>', 'Crepuscular rays over the palms.      The sun''s giving its all.  Crepuscular rays over the patient palms.', '2013-12-28 00:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148399, 1096298, 173844, '<td valign="top">North country people are certainly intrepid.  Why should the depths of winter put a crimp in the fun?  There''s a curiously cool cast to this sunlit scene.</td>', 'North country people are certainly intrepid.  Why should the depths of winter put a crimp in the fun?  There''s a curiously cool cast to this sunlit scene.', '2013-12-28 00:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148400, 1096136, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting and attractive.</td>', 'Interesting and attractive.', '2013-12-28 00:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148401, 1096173, 173844, '<td valign="top">Seems to be working.</td>', 'Seems to be working.', '2013-12-28 00:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148402, 1096011, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2013-12-28 00:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148403, 1095791, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color transitions.</td>', 'Beautiful color transitions.', '2013-12-28 00:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148404, 1096030, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful atmospheric photograph.  I''m less sure of the outer peripheries.</td>', 'Wonderful atmospheric photograph.  I''m less sure of the outer peripheries.', '2013-12-28 00:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148406, 1095783, 173844, '<td valign="top">Is the color "real?"  Sorry, that means something to me.  If so, stunning.</td>', 'Is the color "real?"  Sorry, that means something to me.  If so, stunning.', '2013-12-28 00:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148408, 1096297, 173844, '<td valign="top">This scene is so familiar to me that it''s hard to critique.  That being said, I like the open foreground with all that humanity calmly packed into the thin strip of background.  I also like the interplay of shadows with the painted white lines of the crosswalk.</td>', 'This scene is so familiar to me that it''s hard to critique.  That being said, I like the open foreground with all that humanity calmly packed into the thin strip of background.  I also like the interplay of shadows with the painted white lines of the crosswalk.', '2013-12-28 00:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148410, 1095697, 173844, '<td valign="top">The causality is hard to argue with.</td>', 'The causality is hard to argue with.', '2013-12-28 00:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148414, 1096190, 173844, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image with its undulations and fog and the man walking away from the viewer in the distance.  The contrail even enhances the rayed sun.  The figure-like silhouette on the hillside horizon adds a further note of mystery.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'A beautiful image with its undulations and fog and the man walking away from the viewer in the distance.  The contrail even enhances the rayed sun.  The figure-like silhouette on the hillside horizon adds a further note of mystery.  One of my favorites.', '2013-12-28 00:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148488, 1096249, 173350, '<td valign="top">Nice. I could look at this for hours.</td>', 'Nice. I could look at this for hours.', '2013-12-28 11:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148556, 1096024, 62249, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Did you consider a vertical crop to emphasize the strong line pointing to the setting sun?</td>', 'Interesting. Did you consider a vertical crop to emphasize the strong line pointing to the setting sun?', '2013-12-28 13:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148557, 1096211, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot very well, with the horizon placed so close to the bottom edge. The clouds are way over processed, even for HDR.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot very well, with the horizon placed so close to the bottom edge. The clouds are way over processed, even for HDR.', '2013-12-28 13:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148637, 1096190, 16046, '<td valign="top">Best in show award, congrats</td>', 'Best in show award, congrats', '2013-12-28 21:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
