(7149224, 1096190, 96751, '<td valign="top">Alessandro, you have created an extraordinary image. The sense of scale, the perfectly placed cloud, the fog, and the lone hiker. To use one of your favorite words: EPIC</td>', 'Alessandro, you have created an extraordinary image. The sense of scale, the perfectly placed cloud, the fog, and the lone hiker. To use one of your favorite words: EPIC', '2013-12-29 23:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
