(7149341, 1096261, 114285, '<td valign="top">I would of cropped the sky out, and just left the trees in the image, but that''s me! Great reflections though.</td>', 'I would of cropped the sky out, and just left the trees in the image, but that''s me! Great reflections though.', '2013-12-30 03:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
